{"lines": ["Tus dientes ya se largaron, pendejo. Llevan una semana sin verte la cara.", "Cómo lavarse los dientes. Primero, tome el cepillo. Ese palito peludo que usa para rascarse la espalda, cochino.", "Ahora ponga pasta. Un chorrito. No se coma el tubo completo, hijo de puta.", "Cepille despacio. Arriba, abajo. Ay, cabrón, ese era un diente. Qué pinche descuido.", "Enjuáguese. Con agua, no con cerveza, borracho de mierda.", "Felicidades. Ya no tiene dientes. Ahorró en dentista, y en dignidad también."], "words": [["Tus", 0.0, 0.186], ["dientes", 0.221, 0.511], ["ya", 0.534, 0.592], ["se", 0.627, 0.673], ["largaron,", 0.708, 1.184], ["pendejo.", 1.207, 1.8], ["Llevan", 1.939, 2.159], ["una", 2.183, 2.264], ["semana", 2.31, 2.601], ["sin", 2.635, 2.728], ["verte", 2.752, 2.937], ["la", 2.972, 3.019], ["cara.", 3.065, 3.506], ["Cómo", 3.715, 3.889], ["lavarse", 3.913, 4.168], ["los", 4.191, 4.284], ["dientes.", 4.319, 4.911], ["Primero,", 5.12, 5.561], ["tome", 5.631, 5.84], ["el", 5.863, 5.921], ["cepillo.", 5.956, 6.56], ["Ese", 6.769, 6.943], ["palito", 6.978, 7.198], ["peludo", 7.233, 7.546], ["que", 7.593, 7.663], ["usa", 7.697, 7.814], ["para", 7.848, 7.953], ["rascarse", 8.011, 8.348], ["la", 8.371, 8.417], ["espalda,", 8.44, 8.789], ["cochino.", 8.812, 9.392], ["Ahora", 9.672, 9.893], ["ponga", 9.939000000000002, 10.183000000000002], ["pasta.", 10.241000000000001, 10.833000000000002], ["Un", 10.961000000000002, 11.077000000000002], ["chorrito.", 11.123000000000001, 11.808000000000002], ["No", 12.075000000000001, 12.180000000000001], ["se", 12.215000000000002, 12.273000000000001], ["coma", 12.319, 12.482000000000001], ["el", 12.505, 12.551000000000002], ["tubo", 12.598, 12.749], ["completo,", 12.772000000000002, 13.155000000000001], ["hijo", 13.178, 13.353000000000002], ["de", 13.387000000000002, 13.434000000000001], ["puta.", 13.492, 13.829], ["Cepille", 14.109000000000002, 14.411000000000001], ["despacio.", 14.445000000000002, 15.084000000000001], ["Arriba,